## Audit Standards Applied

1. Walk-forward validation only — no look-ahead bias
2. Wilson CIs on all classification metrics
3. Baseline comparison required — every model vs naive
4. Regime-stratified results (Pre-COVID / COVID / Post-COVID)
5. Honest null results documented with root cause analysis
6. No data leakage — features available BEFORE release date
7. Diebold-Mariano test for regression, McNemar for classification
8. McNemar direction verified (b vs c) — significant worse ≠ significant better

